desc: Dawn Chorus (Classic Chorus RE-01 port) by chmaha
author: chmaha
version: 1.0
changelog:
  Initial release.
about:
  Stereo chorus with a vintage flavour: delay range from 1.25 to 320 ms with a fine trim, LFO rate and depth,
  stereo spread, mix and level, running at twice the host rate, plus 16 factory presets that reach from subtle
  chorus to flanging. Classic Chorus RE-01 is AnClark Liu's recreation of a much-loved free studio chorus from
  the early 2000s; this port matches its DSP.
  Ported from Classic Chorus RE-01 by AnClark Liu (GPL-3.0-or-later) https://github.com/AnClark/ClassicChorus-RE01
  Title lettering drawn from the outlines of Linden Hill by Barry Schwartz (SIL Open Font License 1.1)
  JSFX version released under GPL-3.0-or-later
  Claude generated some of this code
